 the red silk ribbon drifting across her shoulder. The camera holds a static shot as her lips part slightly. [Shot 3] At 00:04.500, the camera cuts to a full-body wide shot revealing her entire figure standing beneath the cherry blossoms, the layered Hanfu skirt and wide sleeves flowing in the breeze as she takes one graceful step forward and turns her body. The camera pulls out with small amplitude at slow speed while cherry petals spiral down around her, the red ribbon streaming behind her against the twilight sky. [Shot 4] At 00:06.500, the camera cuts to a medium close-up of her face and shoulders as she lifts her chin, fixes her eyes directly into the lens, and lets a faint, elegant smile form at the corners of her lips. The camera pushes in slowly with very small amplitude, then holds a static shot as a single petal drifts across the foreground and she holds the final pose until the end of the video.\n\noverall_soundscape: A gentle breeze passes through the cherry blossoms with a soft rustle of silk as she moves, and a few petals whisper through the air; the tassels sway almost silently in the twilight.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A guofeng R&B track at a laid-back moderate tempo, combining plucked guzheng and pipa phrases with a smooth R&B groove built on a soft kick, swung hi-hats, and warm sub-bass; the rhythm stays relaxed and groovy throughout, with the plucked strings becoming more prominent in the final shot and ending on a sustained, fading note."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [454.07012939453125, 513.0809326171875], "pos": [5284.80126953125, 605.7295532226562], "id": 55, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 15}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "links": [545], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["CLIP"], "inputs": [], "flags